
-------------------------------------
User CAs, Certificates
-------------------------------------
To create the RSA user CA key files:

  $ ssh-keygen -t rsa -C "ProFTPD mod_sftp Testing RSA CA Key" -f authorized_user_rsa_ca_key

  # After this, manually edit the generated text to replace the OpenSSH
  # Comment with the above -C text.
  $ ssh-keygen -e -f ./authorized_user_rsa_ca_key.pub > authorized_user_rsa_ca_keys

To sign the RSA user certificates:

  $ ssh-keygen -s authorized_user_rsa_ca_key -I "mod_sftp test RSA cert" -n proftpd -V +30d -z 1 ../test_rsa_key.pub
  $ mv ../test_rsa_key-cert.pub ./user_rsa_ca_rsa_cert.pub

  # For use for AllowMatchPrincipals integration tests
  $ ssh-keygen -s authorized_user_rsa_ca_key -I "mod_sftp test RSA cert with AllowMatchPrincipals" -n 'pr?ftp*' -V +30d -z 6 ../test_rsa_key.pub
  $ mv ../test_rsa_key-cert.pub ./user_rsa_ca_rsa_cert_match_principals.pub

  $ ssh-keygen -s authorized_user_rsa_ca_key -I "mod_sftp test ECDSA256 cert" -n proftpd -V +30d -z 2 ../test_ecdsa256_key.pub
  $ mv ../test_ecdsa256_key-cert.pub ./user_rsa_ca_ecdsa256_cert.pub

  $ ssh-keygen -s authorized_user_rsa_ca_key -I "mod_sftp test ECDSA384 cert" -n proftpd -V +30d -z 3 ../test_ecdsa384_key.pub
  $ mv ../test_ecdsa384_key-cert.pub ./user_rsa_ca_ecdsa384_cert.pub

  $ ssh-keygen -s authorized_user_rsa_ca_key -I "mod_sftp test ECDSA521 cert" -n proftpd -V +30d -z 4 ../test_ecdsa521_key.pub
  $ mv ../test_ecdsa521_key-cert.pub ./user_rsa_ca_ecdsa521_cert.pub

  $ ssh-keygen -s authorized_user_rsa_ca_key -I "mod_sftp test ED25519 cert" -n proftpd -V +30d -z 5 ../test_openssh_ed25519_key.pub
  $ mv ../test_openssh_ed25519_key-cert.pub ./user_rsa_ca_ed25519_cert.pub

------------------------------------------
To create the ECDSA256 user CA key files:

